    *   k=2: P[1][2] {NT35} + P[3][5] {} = {}
    *   k=3: P[1][3] {NT35} + P[4][5] {} = {}
    *   k=4: P[1][4] {NT25} + P[5][5] {NT37}
        *   `NT25 NT37 -> NT39`
    *   P[1][5] = {NT39}
*   P[2][6] (`t9 t17 t15 t10 t13`): All splits result in empty sets. P[2][6] = {}

